WEBVTT

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.000
Wait! He has nothing
to do with this!

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.020
Let him go!

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.100
In order to defeat Kaguro,

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.800
Yoshimori let himself get captured
by the Kokuboro and made it inside.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.740
But with Sen Kagemiya
being held hostage,

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.610
he was unable to do anything.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:27.980
Tokine chased after Yoshimori,
and slipped into Kokuboro.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.130
And there is also another.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:47.140
I'm guessing that
you're a poor little sacrifice,

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:50.840
brought to this crumbling castle
for your Kekkaishi powers.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.940
Is that right, Yoshimori-kun?

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.320
Like I said, who are you?

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:01.290
It was Matsudo Heisuke,
a man thought to have already died.

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:04.220
In order to kill his archnemesis,

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.630
he has also infiltrated
the Other World.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:12.830
My target is the white one.
Do not attack him.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.940
I'm planning the performance
of a lifetime.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.700
I will not allow
an audience, either.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.000
As all their desires cross paths,

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.910
the battle is about to begin in

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:29.610
the crumbling castle
of the Kokuboro.

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:31.880
For starters,

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:35.980
shall we destroy the castle as we
move through it, Kagami-kun?

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.420
Yes, Professor.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:43.730
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:45.600
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:50.810
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.710
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:56.140
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:00.550
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.090
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:07.420
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:13.090
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.590
Sha la la la la...

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:24.010
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.970
(Secret romance)

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:31.180
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.940
(A strange distance)

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:39.790
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:40.860
Yeah

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.330
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.930
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:53.270
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.480
What is that?!

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:29.470
That structure looks nice.
Destroy it.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:31.360
Yes, Professor.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:42.350
What is that thing?!
What is it doing to my castle?!

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:02.530
Hoi! Joso!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.360
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.170
I don't have time to deal with you!

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:11.740
I'm coming, Kagemiya!
I'll save you!

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.180
There he is! Catch him!

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:15.940
Ketsu!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:40.200
Man, I wish I was deployed to
Karasumori so I could power up.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.040
You didn't hear?

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:46.380
Task Force One went to Karasumori,
lost, and came back.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:47.700
Really?!

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.270
Yeah. Sakon-sama was killed, too.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.420
Karasumori sure is dangerous!

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:54.650
Yup! Yup!

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.860
You're so ugly!

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.800
W-What did you say?!

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.380
You tried so hard to take
the form of a human,

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.070
but you still have
a long way to go.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.770
You have to change form beautifully
like me to make it work.

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:26.980
I don't want to hear that
from an Ayakashi!

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:38.320
This place is huge...
Where are the stairs?

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.460
Don't they have elevators
or something?

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:01.680
Kaguro!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:22.370
No...

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.010
I have to get Kagemiya!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.220
What? He's not coming?

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.810
This happened because I let myself
worry about that idiot!

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:08.780
Damn it!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.100
What are you?! A human?

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:19.160
Get her!

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:22.090
Ketsu!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.500
You fools!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.870
How dare you soil
my beautiful castle

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:31.140
with your filthy blood!

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:33.610
That is punishable by death!

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:35.310
P-Please spare us!

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:44.720
The way they were defeated...
you must be the Kekkaishi!

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.350
What if I am?

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.920
How did you infiltrate the castle?

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:52.190
Or rather, how did you
get into this Other World?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.360
Who knows?

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:54.890
You've got some nerve.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.470
Let's see how long
you can keep that up.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:02.170
I will show you what happens
to those who soil my castle.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:06.140
Your castle? You're the boss here?

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.610
I am the keeper of this castle.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.110
I am an executive
by the name of Koshu!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:14.550
It is my duty to keep
this place beautiful.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.690
And then you came along...

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.460
If you're the castle's keeper,

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:22.420
you should know that
another Kekkaishi was brought here.

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:24.690
Can you tell me where he is?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:28.530
Why should I tell you?!

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:31.200
All right.
Then I'll find him on my own.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.800
Wait!

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:39.410
I'll let you go.
So can you stop bothering me?

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:42.310
I am an executive!
How dare you make a fool out of me!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.150
This is unforgivable.

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.120
I'll punish you!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.330
So that's your true form.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:58.760
Are you scared now?!

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:01.490
Ketsu!

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.730
Let's see how long
you can keep running.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:11.140
Once my tentacles catch hold,
you can never escape.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.510
You're chatty,

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:16.480
so why don't you tell me
where the other Kekkaishi is?

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.350
Do not worry.

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.050
We'll sacrifice both of you
eventually.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:23.480
Sacrifice?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.280
That's right.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.420
I'm going to make fertilizer
out of you for the castle.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.060
The other one escaped...

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:33.720
But there is no way he can escape
my perfectly designed castle.

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:39.010
He's probably lost by now and will
shrivel up and die sooner or later.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:43.480
I see. He escaped...
Yoshimori is free.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:46.340
Silence!
Our chat is over!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:49.240
Ketsu!

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:55.150
I'm sorry it couldn't turn out
the way you wanted.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:56.380
Metsu!

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.580
Stop!

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:08.660
Can't this go any faster?!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.460
Please don't ask
for the impossible.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:12.600
This is as fast as it goes.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:19.710
That fool! Once he's back,
I'll beat some sense into him!

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:24.510
But will Mrs. Yukimura
cooperate with us?

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.910
Don't worry about Tokiko.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:30.710
We have an excuse. We're bringing
her granddaughter back, too.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.650
I won't let her say no.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.120
I sure hope so.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:46.700
What?!

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:58.380
This feeling...

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:00.120
The Black Pampas' castle...

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:04.580
No, the Other World itself
is falling apart...

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.120
I must hurry!

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.640
What is going on?

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:34.480
Byaku...

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.550
Byaku. Where are you?

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:39.620
Byaku...

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:55.870
Byaku...

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:21.930
Metsu!

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:33.740
Are you okay?

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:38.410
This is terrible.
Are you their prisoner, too?

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:41.150
Your legs too!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.920
Hey, if you wanna run away,
you should do it soon.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.480
This castle is...

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:50.350
You...

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:55.060
For a human, you seem strange.
Let me see.

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.220
Oh, my. That's scary.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:16.790
You want to destroy this castle?
What a bad boy...

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.350
Maybe I should kill you...

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:30.630
Huh? What was that?
I feel so dizzy.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:38.370
Maybe it would be more fun
to obliterate the castle...

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.080
It's a shame though.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.520
Your powers can do much
more interesting things

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.490
than just destroy...

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.190
Um, I can't think straight

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.790
and I don't really understand
what you're talking about...

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:57.260
Oh, my... You are so helpless.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:02.300
Humans are so foolish...

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:22.480
Now go.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:26.620
I'm bored of this place, anyway...

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:30.820
Use that power in
any way you wish...

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.370
I wonder who that was...

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.540
It was an Ayakashi, but she
didn't feel evil or anything...

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:42.600
She was elegant,
like a princess.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.530
"Princess"?!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:49.710
Wait, didn't someone
mention that before?

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.350
Oh well.

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:53.740
Now, to go right or left...

00:14:56.820 --> 00:15:00.020
It's to the right.
Huh? Did I just...

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:02.130
I don't really understand, but...

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.050
It's gotta be to the right!

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.020
Ketsu! Ketsu!
Metsu!

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:33.350
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!
Metsu!

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.860
Why, you!
Ketsu!

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:38.160
Metsu!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.430
They just keep popping up...

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:47.130
Bring it! I'll take all of you on!

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.070
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.710
No way...

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:13.160
This size... I can't surround it
by myself all at once!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.830
But if I can stop it from moving...

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:16.960
Ketsu!

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:21.140
Ketsu, Ketsu, Ketsu!

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:24.070
Ketsu, Ketsu, Ketsu, Ketsu, Ketsu!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.280
Stay there!

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:42.860
How big is this castle?!

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.770
How big is this castle?!

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:59.140
Where could he be?

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.540
I believe he's close.

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:02.370
Very well.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:05.150
It certainly makes it worth
the effort to destroy them all.

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:07.450
We will find him eventually.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.320
Let's go...

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:10.250
Yes.

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:14.690
It's this way!

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:26.900
How do I know this? Why?

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:32.140
I get it! It's innate intuition!
I'm so awesome!

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.040
Where are you, Yoshimori?

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.380
Hey! Where are you?

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:40.110
Stop hiding and come out here!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:56.760
Am I going to die?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:17.650
Damn it!
I'm not gonna die here!

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:26.690
I thought I was prepared
for this ever since

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:29.930
I joined the Special Forces
of the Night Troops, but...

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.050
You want me to call the Medics?

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:45.580
No...

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.620
I'll get better if I rest...

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.530
Normal people would
die from those wounds.

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.730
I completed the mission...

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:00.200
So don't tell anyone about this...

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:03.860
You think you can't die
or something?

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:09.500
This... is all I can do...

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:11.610
Suit yourself.

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:14.270
Sen.

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.010
Don't tell anyone.

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.360
Show off...

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:29.420
I was wrong!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:32.820
He had his own convictions...

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.570
That's why he was
able to fight fearlessly.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.840
I didn't understand anything!

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:42.370
Compared to him,
my convictions are nothing!

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:48.010
He had gone through situations
like this so many times...

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:53.310
And yet... I...

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.310
Damn it!

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:01.290
Can't I do more than
just lie on the ground?!

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:05.030
Damn it! Damn it!

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:29.320
What?! It's him!

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:36.390
Bingo!

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:39.560
I knew you were here!

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.430
I'm so smart.

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:48.470
But how did I know?
I ran around a lot...

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.910
I guess it's just that innate
intuition that I have.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:51.600
Yup.

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:56.380
You seem like you're doing fine.

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:03.950
What are you doing here?!

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:07.420
What do you mean?
I came to save you, of course.

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:08.520
Huh?

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.930
Damn... You're all beat up.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:17.370
Show off...
You think you can't die or-

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:22.340
You can stand, right?
Let's get out of here.

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:34.710
What's wrong? Let's go.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.340
Wait up!

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:44.760
The Princess has gone missing?!

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:45.790
Yes...

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:47.360
What do you mean?!

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:52.100
I don't know... She must have
left her quarters on her own...

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:56.130
If the Princess has
left her quarters,

00:21:56.180 --> 00:21:59.040
then no one can stop
the fall of the castle.

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:03.140
Damn! If only Byaku's worm
wasn't inside of me!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:10.380
Princess...

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:20.530
I found you!

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:50.020
With a look on your face that says,
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:53.290
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:57.460
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.060
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:04.870
Trying to avoid an emergency,
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:08.850
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:12.910
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:16.180
I am, it's common sense

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:20.520
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:26.500
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:32.830
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:32.870 --> 00:23:34.810
(if that's true)

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.510
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:42.950
Please Please Please

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:47.150
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:50.490
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:54.760
You watch from far away

00:23:54.800 --> 00:24:00.760
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:01.570 --> 00:24:02.870
Hey Hey
